/T (Tourists in Saudi Arabia often struggle to plan their trips efficiently due to scattered information, limited personalization, and difficulty keeping up with ongoing events or location changes. This leads to unorganized travel experiences and missed opportunities. There is a need for a smart system that simplifies planning and adapts to user preferences and real-time conditions.)
